{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17633","headline":"东渡早梅一树岁华如雪酣赏成咏 · 羊士谔","name":"东渡早梅一树岁华如雪酣赏成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暇日留囗事，期云亦囗开。\n乡心持岁酒，津下赏山梅。\n晚实和商鼎，浓香拂寿杯。\n唯应招北客，日日踏青来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17633.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17633","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}